Node 22 offline fixtures cover version comparisons, stable-vs-testing selection, beta selection, identity conflicts, checksum conflicts, downgrade prevention, growing counts, withdrawn packages, malformed metadata, and cache fallback. Live upstream workflow and iPhone behavior have not been verified in this delivery. No source packages are modified. This does not repair individual source playback defects.